# The raw event stream is 51.65 MB and is NOT committed, following the M7
# convention: no raw measurement data is versioned, and every verifier
# recomputes from frozen seeds instead (see experiments/m7/verify_G15.js).
#
# What IS committed is sufficient to reproduce and validate it exactly:
#   candidates.jsonl   every one of the 2000 candidates with its disposition
#   manifest.json      per-run fingerprint, diagnostics and SHA-256 of that
#                      run's event stream
#   INTEGRITY.sha256   digests of all three artifacts + the regeneration command
#
# Regenerate with:  cd experiments/m8 && node run_collection.js
events.jsonl
